# Honeywell RSCDJJI060MDSE3 Driver

## Purpose

Interface driver for the Honeywell RSCDJJI060MDSE3 differential pressure sensor.

## Responsibilities

- Sensor initialization
- Pressure acquisition
- Temperature acquisition
- Sensor health monitoring
- Communication error handling

## Outputs

- Differential Pressure (Pa)
- Temperature (°C)
- Sensor Status

## Planned APIs

```c
void Honeywell_Init(void);

float Honeywell_ReadPressure(void);

float Honeywell_ReadTemperature(void);

uint8_t Honeywell_GetStatus(void);
